For the first time, we see the complete nightmare. Only the uppw right quarter of Peyton's face remains intact. Perfect., Handsome. But as for the rest... The 3i,a is a hairless skull, covered with random bits of scaranf char. Without the benefit of gums or lips, the entire 3ength of his teeth are exposed down to the root, connec g crookedly to the jaw bone. One ear remains intact, the other a burnt hole. Only the rudimentary cartile forms the nose. But it is the wild eyeballs protruig obscenely from the bone of their sockets, that tell tba,story. There, lies madness; a dark river of evil rage.
